OL,3,GNEWSATwo in hospital after escaping
OL,4,Ahouse fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have been taken to hospital
OL,7,Fwith burns after escaping from a severe
OL,8,Fhouse fire in Market Drayton.
OL,10,FThe blaze broke out at the home on
OL,11,FKings Avenue at 00:41 BST and four
OL,12,Ffirefighters went inside to search the
OL,13,Fburning house, Shropshire Fire and
OL,14,FRescue Service said.
OL,16,FThey worked "extremely hard in
OL,17,Fpunishing temperatures as they made
OL,18,Ftheir way through the property", a
OL,19,Fspokesperson added, but found it became
OL,20,Fmore difficult when part of the first
OL,21,Ffloor collapsed.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
